title Cassette: the recorder's whole cost while recording: the hubs at 20 fps plus a moving level and the counter updated 30 times a second (CASSETTE_DEMO_LIVE=1, as the controller will)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LIVE 1
env CASSETTE_TIMING 1

wait 11000
shot timing-live
expect noquit
